# Supabase Client Configuration (Frontend)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_your_publishable_key_here
# Opsional fallback kompatibilitas:
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key

# Supabase Edge Functions Secrets / Vercel Serverless Webhook Env Vars
# 1. AULAA_API_KEY: API Key proyek Anda dari Dashboard Aulaa (pgw_id_...)
# 2. AULAA_WEBHOOK_SECRET: Webhook Secret dari Dashboard Aulaa untuk verifikasi X-Webhook-Signature
# Jika menggunakan /api/aulaa-webhook di domain website yang sama (Vercel):
# - Mode langsung (disarankan): set AULAA_WEBHOOK_SECRET, SUPABASE_URL, dan SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY di Vercel Environment Variables
# - Mode relay ke Edge Function: set VITE_SUPABASE_URL di Vercel dan deploy `aulaa-webhook` dengan `--no-verify-jwt`
# AULAA_API_KEY=pgw_id_your_api_key_here
# AULAA_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your_aulaa_webhook_secret_here
# SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-supabase-service-role-key
